  "goodToKnow": "Der Schaffner (die Schaffnerin) is a train or tram conductor who checks tickets. Deutsche Bahn's official term today is der Zugbegleiter, but everyone still says Schaffner. In city transport, plain-clothes Kontrolleure check tickets, and riding without one (schwarzfahren) costs a fine, the erhöhtes Beförderungsentgelt, usually 60 euros. The plural is the same: die Schaffner."
